# Desktop variant UX

When editing files under `**/components/ui/**/desktop/**`:

- Apply engineering foundations and `code/web/ui` first.
- Load `skills/code/web/ux/SKILL.md` and **`references/desktop/*`** (not mobile refs).
- Sidebar, hover, wide layout nav: `references/desktop/navigation-motion.md`.
- Overlays, press feedback, motion libs: `references/shared/*`.
- Unsure which viewport applies: `references/viewport-routing.md`.

UI structure and folder placement: paired `desktop-ui.mdc` + `components-ui-hierarchy.md`.
